{"language":"en","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","冰冻之墓"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/en","Frozen Grave"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","对目标造成伤害和冻结，并制造极寒领域施加霜冻。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/en","Carolina deals damage to and freezes an enemy, and creates an arctic field that inflicts Frostbite."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","短暂蓄力后，选择一名敌人，对其造成240% + 20% ATK伤害，并冻结目标6秒。并在目标及其周围2格范围内制造极寒领域，领域内的敌人每2秒会被施加一次“霜冻”状态。优先选择周围2格敌人数量最多的敌人作为目标。每层“霜冻”会使其降低15急速，持续6秒，至多叠加3层。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Carolina selects an enemy after charging up briefly, dealing 240% + 20% ATK damage to the target and freezing them for 6s. Then, she creates an arctic field that inflicts Frostbite on the target and enemies within 2 tiles every 2s. Carolina prioritizes selecting the target with the most enemies in their surrounding 2 tiles, and each stack of Frostbite reduces the target's Haste by 15 for 6s, up to 3 stacks."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":21,"end":27,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":65,"end":71,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":31,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":35,"end":37,"tooltip_key":"keyword:freeze"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":61,"end":75,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":101,"end":109,"tooltip_key":"keyword:freeze"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至260% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 260% + 20% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn"