Frostbite."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","对目标及其周围1格范围内的敌人造成一次155% + 15% ATK伤害，并施加一层“霜冻”。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Carolina deals 155% + 15% ATK damage to a target and adjacent enemies and inflicts a Frostbite stack."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":29,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":19,"end":25,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":19,"end":33,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":15,"end":29,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至165% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 165% + 15% ATK."],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至175% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 175% + 15% ATK."],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至185% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 185% + 15% ATK."],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","妖术雪球"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/en","Snowball Witchery"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","总是会召唤雪球围绕自身，敌人被控制时，雪球会自动攻击造成伤害。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/en","Carolina surrounds herself with snowballs which automatically attack enemies under control effects."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","制造4个雪球围绕自身，每过3秒自动发射一枚雪球攻击目标。另外，当有敌人处于控制状态下，雪球会自动攻击该目标造成130% + 10% ATK伤害，每个敌人受到雪球的攻击有2.5秒间隔。当雪球全部使用后，卡列琳娜会再次制造雪球。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Carolina surrounds herself with 4 snowballs and automatically shoots a snowball to attack enemies every 3s, dealing 130% + 10% ATK damage to the targets under control effects. Each enemy can be attacked by a snowball every 2.5s. Carolina creates more snowballs when they are all used up."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":59,"end":65,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":120,"end":126,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":55,"end":69,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":116,"end":130,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至140% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 140% + 10% ATK."],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至150% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 150% + 10% ATK."],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","每个敌人受到雪球攻击最短间隔缩短至1.5秒。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Reduces each snowball attack on each enemy to 1.5s."],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/name_i18n/en","Hero Focus"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身暴击，当使用多次“妖术雪球”后进一步提升暴击。"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/en","Carolina increases her Crit during battle. She gains extra Crit after casting Snowball Witchery multiple times."],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提高14点暴击，且当使用5次“妖术雪球”后，额外提升18点暴击。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Carolina increases her Crit by 14 during battle. She gains an extra 18 Crit after casting Snowball Witchery 5 times."],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提高19点暴击，且当使用5次“妖术雪球”后，额外提升24点暴击。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Carolina increases her Crit by 19 during battle. She gains an extra 24 Crit after casting Snowball Witchery 5 times."],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提高24点暴击，且当使用5次“妖术雪球”后，额外提升30点暴击。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Carolina increases her Crit by 24 during battle. She gains an extra 30 Crit after casting Snowball Witchery 5 times."],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","冰寒漩涡"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/en","Ice Vortex"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","妖术雪球会造成更高伤害，可造成范围伤害并降低魔法抗性。"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/en","Carolina increases the snowballs' damage when casting Snowball Witchery, dealing AoE damage, and reducing enemies' Magic DEF."],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","卡列琳娜每次使用“妖术雪球”，会永久提升雪球10%伤害，至多提升7次。从第三次使用“妖术雪球”开始，新雪球会造成1格范围的范围伤害并额外降低敌人15%的魔抗，持续6秒。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Carolina permanently increases the snowballs' damage by 10% with each cast of Snowball Witchery, up to 7 times. Starting from the third cast, Carolina deals AoE damage to adjacent tiles with newly produced snowballs and reduces enemies' Magic DEF by 15% for 6s."],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","卡列琳娜的普通攻击攻击被控制的敌人时，使1枚雪球攻击该敌人。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Uses a snowball to attack the same controlled enemy hit by Carolina's normal attacks."],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","降低魔抗的效果提升至25%。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Reduces enemies' Magic DEF by 25%."],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","降低魔抗的效果提升至30%。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Reduces enemies' Magic DEF by 30%."],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/en","Enhance Force"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","“妖术雪球”造成伤害时也会施加“霜冻”。"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/en","Carolina inflicts Frostbite when dealing damage with Snowball Witchery."],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","技能“妖术雪球”的雪球造成伤害时也会施加“霜冻”。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Carolina inflicts Frostbite when dealing damage with Snowball Witchery."],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","拉季诺夫家族烛台"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/en","Radinov Candelabra"]]}